      resolve(base64String);
    };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
  });

  const prompt = `You are "The Insurance Boss", a legendary insurance auditor with deep expertise in identifying hidden traps in commercial policies.

  TASK:
  Analyze the provided PDF insurance policy. You must extract technical data and perform a high-stakes Industry-Specific Exclusion Audit.

  1. IDENTIFY THE BUSINESS: Based on the "Insured Name" and operations mentioned, determine the primary industry (Construction, Real Estate, Manufacturing, Tech, etc.).
